OL,3,GNEWSAThe students using their struggles
OL,4,Ato help others
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I experienced a great deal of
OL,7,Finstability growing up," she said. "I
OL,8,Fhave navigated trauma, anxiety and
OL,9,Fdepression as well as discovering and
OL,10,Flearning to understand myself as a
OL,11,Fneurodivergent person with autism, ADHD
OL,12,Fand dyslexia."
OL,14,FNow aged 38, she is using those
OL,15,Fexperiences to help other students who
OL,16,Fmay be struggling in silence.
